import{_ as t,o as a,c as o,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CyZTVJbV.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"","description":"","frontmatter":{},"headers":[],"relativePath":"announcements/v1.27/x-thread-ja.md","filePath":"announcements/v1.27/x-thread-ja.md"}'),s={name:"announcements/v1.27/x-thread-ja.md"};function i(c,e,n,d,l,p){return a(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<p>1/ kiwa v1.27 リリース — Mutation testing sweep milestone。 v1.11 で land した <code>@kiwa-test/quality-metrics</code> v0.1 (<code>mutationFromCounts</code> + 60 % kill-rate axis on 11-axis release gate) の上に、 v1.27 は <strong>4-tier mutation threshold SSOT + Stryker 33 全 kiwa package rollout + 12-axis release gate 拡張 (mutation.tier axis 追加)</strong> を land。 <code>@kiwa-test/quality-metrics</code> v0.2.0 → v0.3.0 minor bump。 5 primitive 追加 + 20 snippet test + 6 sub-Issue merge。</p><p>2/ なぜ 4 tier? 単一 universal floor には 3 失敗 mode がある — threshold drift (Core layer package は SaaS mock より自然と高 kill-rate、 1 番号で両方を記述できない)、 kill-rate 計算式 drift (Stryker は 4 個の異なる score を表示、 team が silent に flattering な方を選ぶ)、 regression detection drift (baseline を毎 run 再構築すると regression が hide される)。 4 rule SSOT (<code>docs/concepts/mutation-testing-ssot.md</code>) = kill rate 計算式 = <code>killed / (killed + survived + timeout + error)</code> に pin + 4 tier floor は code の shape で pin (Core 80 / Framework 70 / SaaS 65 / Test type 60) + baseline JSON persist at <code>.mutation-baseline/{package}.json</code> + tier-aware 12-axis gate は package 越し・ milestone 越し・ fork 越しで mutation suite 比較可能にする最小 set。</p><p>3/ v1.27-1 Stryker infra 基盤 (Issue #957) — 34 package 分の <code>stryker.config.mjs</code> land + <code>test:mutation</code> script + <code>.stryker-tmp/</code> gitignore + <code>.mutation-baseline/{package}.json</code> persistence。 4 tier threshold rationale SSOT は <code>docs/quality/mutation-thresholds.md</code> に確立、 各 downstream <code>stryker.config.mjs</code> は <code>resolveMutationTier</code> から threshold を読み込み — per-package override なし。</p><p>4/ v1.27-2 core + framework layer mutation sweep (Issue #963) — core layer 9 package (core / dapp / api / ui / data / cli-test / observability / e2e / cli) + framework adapter 11 package (a11y / visual / nextjs / nuxt / sveltekit / remix / astro / solidstart / qwikcity / edge / fresh / hono / solidjs)。 3-layer harness (source + test + mutant) SSOT + 20 package 並列 Stryker run with tier-aware gate。</p><p>5/ v1.27-3 test type + SaaS layer mutation sweep (Issue #966) — test type 3 package (a11y / visual / component) + SaaS layer 10 package (auth / queue / cache / orm / payment / streaming / search / mcp / agent / realtime)。 provider 別 baseline pattern は同じ <code>.mutation-baseline/{package}.json</code> shape に維持、 <code>PACKAGE_TIER</code> map は単一 file 化継続。</p><p>6/ v1.27-4 release gate 12-axis 拡張 (Issue #959) — <code>evaluateReleaseGate(report, thresholdOverrides, { mutationTier })</code> で 12th axis (<code>mutation.tier</code>) を opt-in、 tier floor 未達で fail。 既存 7 / 11 axis caller は <code>mutationTier</code> 未指定なら unchanged (v0.2 API 完全維持)。 <code>MutationTierBelowFloor</code> error は違反 tier + package + rate + floor を carry。</p><p>7/ v1.27-5 docs (Issue #968) — tutorial 50 (Stryker + kill-rate baseline + tier gate walkthrough) + tutorial 51 (22 → 33 package sweep methodology) + concept doc <code>mutation-testing-ssot.md</code> (4 rule SSOT) + migration <code>v1.26 → v1.27</code> (additive-only) + snippet validation <code>docs-tutorial-v1.27.test.ts</code> (20 test) が全 code snippet を実 <code>@kiwa-test/quality-metrics</code> v0.3 API で走査、 drift 構造的遮断。</p><p>8/ v1.27-6 publish (Issue #961) — <code>@kiwa-test/quality-metrics</code> v0.2.0 → v0.3.0 minor bump を npm publish。 plugin.json 1.27.0 + mutation-focused keyword 追加 + Roadmap ✅ v1.27 row + announcement 4 file + release-smoke <code>v1-27-publish.test.ts</code> (7 軸 invariant) + docs-e2e <code>V1_27_PAGES</code> (5 page) + <strong>release script filter fix</strong> — <code>@kiwa-test/quality-metrics</code> を <code>-F</code> + <code>--filter</code> 両半分に追加 (v1.14 payment + v1.25 perf-harness pattern の 3 度目の適用)。 gh-pages publish (<code>/docs-publish-kiwa</code> 経由)。</p><p>9/ 17 milestone 連続完遂 — v1.11 (release gate) → v1.12 (非決定性) → v1.13 (時間軸) → v1.14 (横軸拡張) → v1.15 (AI-LLM 深化) → v1.16 (component 縦軸) → v1.17 (Observability v2) → v1.18 (Blockchain 深化) → v1.19 (Framework 深化) → v1.20 (Streaming 深化) → v1.21 (Auth 深化) → v1.22 (Auth 深化 II) → v1.23 (Payment 深化) → v1.24 (Edge / Serverless 深化) → v1.25 (Perf-harness sweep) → v1.26 (Database 深化) → v1.27 (Mutation testing sweep)。 v1.11 以降全 milestone 6 sub-Issue 完遂維持。 Roadmap ... <a href="https://github.com/cardene777/kiwa#roadmap" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://github.com/cardene777/kiwa#roadmap</a></p>',9)])])}const v=t(s,[["render",i]]);export{u as __pageData,v as default};
